    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Phoenix Protocol is an action-roguelike game set in a cyberpunk world that is easy to learn but hard to master with a focus on complex mechanics with a lot of depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your combat style and set on to explore the rooms and levels of a mysterious lab testing facility. You will encounter many enemies and find upgrades that fundamentally change how you play the game. It is only up to you how you will combine these upgrades into a viable strategy to overcome the final challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668670/extras/794ac3efa307874f5d9c4515b4d678bc.avif?t=1734819817\" width=616 height=472 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Encounter variety of different enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668670/extras/3dc3b1f36bdd84848abedf104308cf5b.poster.avif?t=1734819817\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668670/extras/3dc3b1f36bdd84848abedf104308cf5b.webm?t=1734819817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find epic upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668670/extras/201746dce84b902aa45bb7dbd7f8a685.avif?t=1734819817\" width=616 height=228 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft ultimate items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668670/extras/4d18fda69e894a01b57195c955d9837b.avif?t=1734819817\" width=618 height=350 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Phoenix Protocol is an action-roguelike game set in a cyberpunk world that is easy to learn but hard to master with a focus on complex mechanics with a lot of depth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your combat style and set on to explore the rooms and levels of a mysterious lab testing facility. You will encounter many enemies and find upgrades that fundamentally change how you play the game. It is only up to you how you will combine these upgrades into a viable strategy to overcome the final challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668670/extras/794ac3efa307874f5d9c4515b4d678bc.avif?t=1734819817\" width=616 height=472 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Encounter variety of different enemies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668670/extras/3dc3b1f36bdd84848abedf104308cf5b.poster.avif?t=1734819817\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668670/extras/3dc3b1f36bdd84848abedf104308cf5b.webm?t=1734819817\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find epic upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668670/extras/201746dce84b902aa45bb7dbd7f8a685.avif?t=1734819817\" width=616 height=228 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft ultimate items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2668670/extras/4d18fda69e894a01b57195c955d9837b.avif?t=1734819817\" width=618 height=350 /></span></p>",
